			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 750013301,
					"content": "奇怪，為什麼那些金色花紋同樣都已經飄過去了…在這裡的柱子底下卻沒有出現「鐫光銘印」？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013302,
					"content": "代表這裡的「鐫光銘印」不僅被擠壓出來，還變得不完整了…這下就麻煩了，還要找到分散在他處的「鐫光銘印」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013303,
					"content": "所以那個分散在其他地方的「鐫光銘印」在哪裡？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013304,
					"content": "…我也不知道。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013305,
					"content": "欸…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013306,
					"content": "雖然分散了，但是畢竟仍然受到力量的約束，所以應該就在附近才對，或許需要找找…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013307,
					"content": "呀，呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013308,
					"content": "#怎麼了，你想去那邊？現在{NICKNAME}和我們有更重要的事要做，待會再陪你玩好不好…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013309,
					"content": "嗯…呀！呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013310,
					"content": "意思是…銘印在那邊嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013311
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750013311,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013312,
					"content": "唉呀，聽說就算到了現在，也有龍能夠感應「鐫光銘印」的力量。以前一直以為是傳言，沒想到也許是真的？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013313,
					"content": "#果然{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}不是一隻普通的小嵴鋒龍哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013314,
					"content": "原來你還有這種本事啊，哼，不過比起我這個嚮導，還是有不小的差距的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013315,
					"content": "嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013316,
						750013318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013316,
					"content": "派蒙在嫉妒你哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013317
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750013317,
					"content": "哪有，我的心胸要比看起來的寬廣多了！這、這只是我誇獎的一種方式啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013320,
					"content": "嗯…嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013321,
					"content": "唉…這個小傢伙根本沒聽懂嘛…真是的，如果能夠再聰明一點就好了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013322
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013322,
					"content": "總有牠能夠聽懂的時刻的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013323
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750013323,
					"content": "對啊，而且部族裡負責看顧龍的人們都說，想要能夠和龍互通情感需要花上很長很長的時間。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013324
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013324,
					"content": "而可以跟龍打成一片的秘訣是：耐心與持續不斷地交流。不管是人想去理解龍，還是龍想要理解人，都需要…需要很長的時間哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013325
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013325,
					"content": "#對啊…就像剛才我也沒有意識到{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}想要向我們說什麼一樣呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013326
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013326,
					"content": "#對不起哦，{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013327
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013327,
					"content": "嗯，呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013328
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013328,
					"content": "這個你倒是回應得很快！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013329
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013329,
					"content": "好啦，那就朝著你剛才想去的地方，去找找看有沒有那種金色花紋吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750013318,
					"content": "派蒙在誇獎你啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013319
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750013319,
					"content": "是誇獎沒錯，不過一定不能因此驕傲自大…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750013320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		}
	]
}